{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_02_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:576f377fce860e295ff106c07a591e78bdc6cc57daeb5d2a32911e7083453f30",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "数个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9551bfe410a06aeeb41acd3aed9b752778999312a620c9fe941934175b4a2c63",
      "text": "呵呵呵……真不愧是我们Jupiter。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c4a4eb461d7aa7a01c07e99ec3d5277751acf59ae5bbeae56221996dbb2d04",
      "text": "披露了出道单曲的音乐节目，\n获得了巨大的成功……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc7f092b2211fad98fe3402ef2de717b7eb33d8bd5a0be315a0be23495f281a",
      "text": "Jupiter的知名度水涨船高，\n一口气登上了巨星之位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae9f51f4d02b27d63b89d98ddbd7be1cea0f6f4474b9bb685dc6dbfce9d4a9a",
      "text": "之后发售的CD，也是一直\n稳坐月销量榜第1名的位置呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fef7276277a8d0102e5b9b9b43f7946a5ff080651aa8a4be76857bb06e74123",
      "text": "我姐姐她们啊，\n每天都在听Jupiter的CD哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373d8d48d83451a7ad85c0011a2944edfe59a1125b53b6edee5d09f625c9e15c",
      "text": "翔太的家人还是一如既往地感情融洽呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fec084e15ace1c1443ff77b66cc998cacdf5cdd96f9cd6546b3c8aae0c30040",
      "text": "我在街上走的时候，被天使酱\n搭话的次数也比以前增多了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56de6ba849e03c77a8bf73f621e7eee5a5cc2e67cbe0a5f99381718d810c141",
      "text": "我切身感受到大家都在热议我们呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5cf42b2d74a4e0945afb87635a36ca917a795f3ebbd682202513f13458fac91",
      "text": "是啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e662d86ecbaebcb8f125981a456530ee6a4461050c5c51c5a791236cef7eab",
      "text": "拿到第1名这个数字固然让人高兴，但有那么多人听了我们的歌，\n才是最让我开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eaf85821eb1d75015aea5aa80b431e5f7cc7cb1520f5073067d41e9a807dec6",
      "text": "（经过练习，提升实力，并化作结果……\n做偶像，真的太快乐了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
